Z||000000||sdm1964||03-01-2001||06:52 AM||||As a few of you know I am deploying in 8 days to Bosnia for SFOR 9. I am a full time national guardsman and will be gone for 6 months.If you care to check out our unit web sight it is <A HREF="http://www.battledragons.com." TARGET=_blank>www.battledragons.com.</A>  The official goverment web sight is <A HREF="http://www.tfeagle.army.mil." TARGET=_blank>www.tfeagle.army.mil.</A>  I will try and keep tabs on the forum while i am gone. I will try and say farewell before I go.<P>Stephen||||reg||7
